# React. Rules: .claude/rules/react.md

id: REACT-PUBLIC-SECRET
severity: block
files: \.(js|jsx|ts|tsx|mjs|cjs|env|local)$|\.env
match: (NEXT_PUBLIC|VITE|REACT_APP|PUBLIC|GATSBY)_[A-Z0-9_]*(SECRET|PRIVATE|PASSWORD|API_?KEY|TOKEN|CREDENTIAL)
why: A client-prefixed variable is compiled into the bundle and is public by definition. Read this on the server and pass down only what the view needs. See .claude/rules/react.md.

id: REACT-DANGEROUS-HTML-VAR
severity: block
files: \.(jsx|tsx)$
match: __html:[[:space:]]*[a-zA-Z_$]
unless: (DOMPurify|sanitize|Sanitize|SANITIZE)
why: dangerouslySetInnerHTML with a variable is XSS unless the value was sanitized against an allowlist first. See .claude/rules/react.md.

id: REACT-JAVASCRIPT-URI
severity: block
files: \.(js|jsx|ts|tsx)$
match: (href|src|action)[[:space:]]*=[[:space:]]*["'{]*[[:space:]]*['"]?javascript:
why: A javascript: URI in an href executes on click. Validate the scheme against an allowlist. See .claude/rules/react.md.

id: REACT-TOKEN-IN-STORAGE
severity: warn
files: \.(js|jsx|ts|tsx)$
match: (localStorage|sessionStorage)\.setItem\([^)]*(token|jwt|secret|password|api_?key)
why: Anything in web storage is readable by any XSS on the origin. Prefer an HttpOnly cookie. See .claude/rules/react.md.

id: REACT-INDEX-AS-KEY
severity: warn
files: \.(jsx|tsx)$
match: key=\{[[:space:]]*(i|idx|index)[[:space:]]*\}
why: An index key on a list that reorders, filters, or deletes hands one row's state to another. Key by identity. See .claude/rules/react.md.

id: REACT-EFFECT-NO-CLEANUP-FETCH
severity: warn
files: \.(jsx|tsx)$
match: useEffect\([^)]*fetch\(
why: A fetch in an effect needs an AbortController and a cleanup return, or an unmount mid-flight sets state on nothing. See .claude/rules/react.md.
